{"synopsis":"Yeon Woo-hyuk adalah pemain setia game misteri yang berlatar dunia bela diri. Suatu hari, dia terbangun di dalam game tersebut sebagai seorang pejabat rendah. Dia mengingat semua kasus penting dari game itu dan mulai memecahkan kejahatan untuk bertahan hidup. Namun, kemampuan khususnya, “Spirit Eye”, ternyata merupakan gejala aneh dari tubuhnya yang terbuka secara paksa. Sekarang, dia bukan hanya seorang pegawai yang menangani kasus, tapi juga seorang yang harus belajar bela diri untuk bertahan hidup di dunia Murim yang mematikan. Bisakah seorang pegawai sipil bertahan di dunia yang berbahaya ini?","alternative_title":"무림 속 공무원으로 살아가는 법","author":"Pengseu, Writing Machine","artist":"KZV","chapters":[{"number":"69","chapter":"69","slug":"2bb39b7f-824a-4976-9cbc-84810a59b86e","title":"Chapter 69","date":"2026-07-30"},{"number":"68","chapter":"68","slug":"661e7233-0d30-422b-b149-cd8eb5f4423a","title":"Chapter 68","date":"2026-07-29"},{"number":"67","chapter":"67","slug":"e8675596-1f74-4345-8626-8c3a07a23497","title":"Chapter 67","date":"2026-07-28"},{"number":"66","chapter":"66","slug":"21e9c72e-bcf2-4491-b2b9-2875f6e1586a","title":"Chapter 66","date":"2026-07-26"},{"number":"65","chapter":"65","slug":"4bec2425-adb4-4448-91d9-8f13b5085e85","title":"Chapter 65","date":"2026-07-25"},{"number":"64","chapter":"64","slug":"93fd272c-0080-4915-b2aa-30161ed1f20b","title":"Chapter 64","date":"2026-07-24"},{"number":"63","chapter":"63","slug":"9e2f6933-dbda-4d98-8bf6-1f132ac57e92","title":"Chapter 63","date":"2026-07-23"},{"number":"62","chapter":"62","slug":"66c0dc8c-62b2-4de5-9a3e-692ca7688996","title":"Chapter 62","date":"2026-07-22"},{"number":"61","chapter":"61","slug":"8825c155-5d81-41ba-a8ff-45d0ac586df3","title":"Chapter 61","date":"2026-07-21"},{"number":"60","chapter":"60","slug":"3b36ef92-1875-42dd-9560-98cd99a06622","title":"Chapter 60","date":"2026-07-21"},{"number":"59","chapter":"59","slug":"cd0ce665-391d-430e-ae71-b638647925d7","title":"Chapter 59","